docs {
  Local setup from the io-messages repository root:

  1. docker compose up -d azurite redis mock-server-send mock-server-apim
  2. docker compose run --rm azurite-setup
  3. docker compose --profile local-test up -d rc-app (starts Cosmos and its fixture seeder)
  4. From another terminal, run: pnpm --filter messages-app dev

  Copy apps/messages-app/.env.example to apps/messages-app/.env before starting messages-app.
}
